{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-2-2","kind":"proposition","title":"线段整体与分段矩形面积","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut at random, the rectangle contained by the whole and both of the segments is equal to the square on the whole.","book":2,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","contentId":"euclid-2-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df27433cb936c54daaebc3e374b36306e417869c3402c9dfa55ca816beb32b47","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-2-2.statement","euclid-2-2.construction.1","euclid-2-2.construction.2","euclid-2-2.proof.1","euclid-2-2.proof.2","euclid-2-2.proof.3","euclid-2-2.proof.4","euclid-2-2.conclusion","euclid-2-2.historical.1","euclid-2-2.historical.2","euclid-2-2.historical.3","euclid-2-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-2-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c37b0cf5d3431ea0465d52771c690efc6712809be8b53a9628a32dd77b5bddc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut at random, the rectangle contained by the whole and both of the segments is equal to the square on the whole."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一条直线随机切除,则由整个和两个部分组成的矩形等于整个正方形。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任两分之其元线上直角方形与元线偕两分线两矩内直角形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直线的任一半上，金属线上的平方和两弧内部的矩形之和相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d07bdaf4b075f5988b93c6395fa7f882d5c8b51d2abeb134fc49ef7821cb12d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line AB be cut at random at the point C; I say that the rectangle contained by AB, BC together with the rectangle contained by BA, AC is equal to the square on AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB线的线AB线在C点随机切开;我说,由AB、BC和AB组成的矩形和由BA、AC组成的矩形等于AB和正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba5576b75211f42dd90604fd320013f4993c8bc333a2bd3a9befacf12d91c62d","citations":["euclid-1-46","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square ADEB be described on AB [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)], and let CF be drawn through C parallel to either AD or BE. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,CF,C,与AD或BE平行。（相关点与线段：ADEB） [[I. 46](/principles/euclid-1-46)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b2031f394de80926bf6940461ef74aa4e38ade778439695fc4636544a8ae9ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then AE is equal to AF, CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE等于AF,CE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2822bb73e9cfc063029ab0188105c86ddf9166d348c69803ef696229063a4e7b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now AE is the square on AB;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在AE是AB的正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a14c4543d0895137347d4b182621f98107e2e3ba16b8fdf30a8916b6ba9fbd7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"AF is the rectangle contained by BA, AC, for it is contained by DA, AC, and AD is equal to AB; and CE is the rectangle AB, BC, for BE is equal to AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AF是BA,AC组成的矩形,DA是DA,AC,AD是AB;CE是矩形,AB,BC是AB。（相关点与线段：BE）"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3f4bca9e284485b7b7084162b15dcbbb1b1443e4c5a944bb46782aa7e641e10","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the rectangle BA, AC together with the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 BA,AC和矩形 AB,BC等于AB的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6602812b9d6b866f0c5970490404611cec3639a7183f97e82b7ac0035d011481","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任两分之其元线上直角方形与元线偕两分线两矩内直角形并等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在直线的任一半上，金属线上的平方和两弧内部的矩形之和相等"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d34bb918ac6b99c63cf5f1319f4864e446c032a5c4d3ebe93164250b967c9318","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试于甲乙线上作甲丁直角方形从丙点作己丙垂线与甲戊乙丁平行〈一卷卅一〉其甲戊与甲乙既等〈一卷卅四〉则甲己直角形在甲乙甲丙矩线内乙丁与甲乙既等则丙丁直角形在甲乙丙乙矩线内而此两形并与甲丁直角方形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：在 甲乙 线上画一个正方形 甲丁。从点 丙 出发，画一条垂直线 己丙 与 甲戊乙丁 平行。〈一卷卅一〉，其中 甲戊 和 甲乙 相等。〈一卷卅四〉 则矩形 甲己 位于 甲乙甲丙 矩阵内。由于 乙丁 和 甲乙 相等，则矩形 丙丁 位于 甲乙丙乙 矩阵内，这两种形状一起形成正方形 甲丁。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6384639c41adddc4a297a2f40222959f5b1170a00c6c21e8fc19164bae4d648f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：以数明之设十数任两分之为七为三十乘七为七十及十乘三为三十之两小实与十自之百一大羃等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注：用数字说明，设定数字为十，将其分成两部分：七等于三十，七乘七等于七十，十乘三等于三十；小的实际值等于十的平方一百零一。"}]},{"id":"euclid-2-2.source","contentId":"euclid-2-2","revisionId":"euclid-2-2@raw-df27433cb936c54d","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42a2c3409c4f48faf7f9b5be5e667f5679ef08b7d72515a9f9e905bb890e9b0f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷二"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-2-2:euclid-1-46:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-2.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-46","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:2.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"I. 46"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-2-2:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-2-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-2-2.